{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>ספרו</b> — Three times in the Masorah: here, and the others: ספרו בגוים את כבודו — one in Psalms and one in Chronicles. Concerning the telling that they told — ספרו בגוים — the glory of Joseph, that they praised him before Pharaoh."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 40, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:18:04.673635005Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}